<p>Hi <%= recipientName %>,</p>
<p>Your archival job for <strong><%= backupConfigName %></strong> on the <strong><%= crmName %></strong> org has failed.</p>
<p><strong>Job ID:</strong> <%= backupJobId %></p>
<% if (errorMessage) { %>
<p><strong>Reason:</strong> <%= errorMessage %></p>
<% } %>
<% if (failedObjects && failedObjects.length) { %>
<p><strong>Affected objects:</strong> <%= failedObjects.join(', ') %></p>
<% } %>
<p>Records that were already archived successfully are unaffected. You can retry the failed objects from your dashboard, or reach out if this keeps happening.</p>
